                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear and light armour. May have a shield (+2 pts). May ride in a Hittite chariot (bought at an additional cost from the list). (Armies of Antiquity p.7)</characteristic>
