              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">One crewman armed with bow, shield and light armour, riding in a two-horse light chariot with a driver. The crewman may have a thrusting spear (+3 pts) and javelins (+3 pts). Hurrian, Syrian and Canaanite chariots do not suffer -1 to hit for moving while shooting. (Armies of Antiquity p.7)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
